%% Sequence: save, go offline, sync, conflict (24 Oct build code; re-check against final build)
sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as UI
  participant PS as planService
  participant Repo as repository
  participant Q as queue
  participant S as sync
  participant API as mockSyncApi
  UI->>PS: savePlan(task)
  PS->>PS: validateTaskInput
  PS->>Repo: saveTask (version + 1, pending)
  PS->>Q: enqueueTask
  Note over UI,Q: Offline: task shows as waiting
  UI->>S: Sync now (online)
  S->>Q: next pending operation
  S->>API: send operation with operationId
  alt 200 or duplicate
    API-->>S: ok
    S->>Repo: markTaskSynced
    S->>Q: completeOperation
  else 409 stale version
    API-->>S: conflict
    S->>Q: markConflict
  else 400, 422 or 503
    API-->>S: error
    S->>Q: record attempt and lastError
  end
  UI->>PS: resolve (keep my version or use server version)
